WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:04.940
The CIS Controls are a prioritized collection of cybersecurity best practices designed to

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:07.360
help organizations improve security outcomes.

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:11.895
They provide practical guidance across key security domains and help organizations focus

00:00:11.895 --> 00:00:14.955
resources on activities that reduce risk.

00:00:14.955 --> 00:00:18.480
Implementation Groups help organizations sequence controls based on risk, resources,

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:19.960
complexity, and maturity.

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:22.620
Because they are actionable, flexible, and widely recognized,

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:26.580
the CIS Controls are frequently used as a foundation for security improvement efforts.
